{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/3e08423ab6dd5bac2e25d5179e7e4d93.avif?t=1771247186\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras_big/3e08423ab6dd5bac2e25d5179e7e4d93.avif?t=1771247186 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources as you build, survive, and stay ahead of the relentless storm on your tail. Unlock new epic buildings, build shields to protect your structures, or place turrets and go on the offensive. Brave blizzards and fiery tornadoes - and discover ways to neutralize them before they tear your bridge apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you build the longest bridge and stay ahead of the danger?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/8d3c0b01d73e03f2f8392ef59a84e4e2.poster.avif?t=1771247186\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/8d3c0b01d73e03f2f8392ef59a84e4e2.webm?t=1771247186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/8d3c0b01d73e03f2f8392ef59a84e4e2.mp4?t=1771247186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/ff2d5f36c42dc63c737de8fee4da4551.avif?t=1771247186\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras_big/ff2d5f36c42dc63c737de8fee4da4551.avif?t=1771247186 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settlers are the lifeblood of your bridge settlement. They staff buildings, keep production running, and make sure your resource chains don\u2019t fall apart. Keep them fed, warm, happy, and healthy as the storm closes in, and plan housing and essentials so your community can grow instead of panic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your settlement expands, assign specialized roles like farmers, scientists, and engineers to boost key buildings and unlock stronger systems. The right people in the right jobs can mean the difference between a smooth run and a collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This bridge isn\u2019t just a crossing - it\u2019s a moving, living community you\u2019re trying to keep alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/dc327498db97502171ddc8f87d1379d7.poster.avif?t=1771247186\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/dc327498db97502171ddc8f87d1379d7.webm?t=1771247186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/dc327498db97502171ddc8f87d1379d7.mp4?t=1771247186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/86a685f31110f13141074bdc83c01db2.avif?t=1771247186\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras_big/86a685f31110f13141074bdc83c01db2.avif?t=1771247186 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Losing and restarting is part of the experience! Every run teaches you something new. Permanent upgrades carry over between attempts, making you stronger and helping you push farther each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit adorable companions along the way - whether it\u2019s five unicorns or a whole zoo of critters (dogs, penguins, frogs, chickens, even an armadillo). Each pet grants a unique buff that can shape your strategy. As you progress, you\u2019ll also unlock traits that offer meaningful bonuses, like extra starting resources or faster production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/78e229bb2852839ff32b0bc4ffebe629.poster.avif?t=1771247186\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/78e229bb2852839ff32b0bc4ffebe629.webm?t=1771247186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/78e229bb2852839ff32b0bc4ffebe629.mp4?t=1771247186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/1c3fe284576bb79aa9ed38193ae4afb0.avif?t=1771247186\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras_big/1c3fe284576bb79aa9ed38193ae4afb0.avif?t=1771247186 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across distinct biomes as you piece together clues about the storm\u2019s origins. Each region brings new mechanics, new tools, and new threats - and forces you to adapt your strategy to survive:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tundra:</strong> Find ways to withstand freezing temperatures, manage heat, and keep your settlers from shutting down in the cold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sky:</strong> Launch helicopter expeditions to reach far-off locations, gather valuable resources, and rescue anyone stranded there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Underwater:</strong> Mine scrap and salvage lost tech to manufacture repair bots and keep your bridge running even when the environment turns hostile.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every biome changes how you build, how you plan, and what you\u2019ll need to overcome next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/83b56f521a376b8011405dc69deb8317.poster.avif?t=1771247186\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/83b56f521a376b8011405dc69deb8317.webm?t=1771247186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/83b56f521a376b8011405dc69deb8317.mp4?t=1771247186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/242a0c19d6f6aba61368e6d015c08d38.avif?t=1771247186\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras_big/242a0c19d6f6aba61368e6d015c08d38.avif?t=1771247186 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it\u2019s not all pressure: between runs, you can slow down on your own peaceful island - a cozy, disaster-free space where you use the resources you\u2019ve earned to build your dream home base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock cosmetics too, from glowing hair to fancy accessories, and personalize both your character and your bridge settlement in style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/440a9bb03954aae59ee215292af478e2.poster.avif?t=1771247186\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/440a9bb03954aae59ee215292af478e2.webm?t=1771247186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/440a9bb03954aae59ee215292af478e2.mp4?t=1771247186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Long bridge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3362750/e96929878f02e087bd92b0d241c483a8bd964dd0.jpg"},{"name":"Longer bridge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3362750/2bfa8dce117cf29dfc35b07bb1dfee56ea36d6ce.jpg"},{"name":"Longest bridge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3362750/9cf2ed1ac9347a72ba54377845055a1ae043b9dc.jpg"},{"name":"Gimme settlers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3362750/0a932e0aca562573a28fbef6c88d174394986127.jpg"},{"name":"Overcrowding","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3362750/969ecbbe1c088ac481d724b2ce8e82240a869652.jpg"},{"name":"Overpopulation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3362750/961ee83e3a88aacd81987fc271ac298de1cd69ea.jpg"},{"name":"Rich","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3362750/1c60573e5d2f7331e4f9f1408bd27ffd3d7be214.jpg"},{"name":"Very rich","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3362750/081f51ae25ae43adb8879848d6138e3e39418067.jpg"},{"name":"Super rich","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3362750/db5ca02ae4ecc8e3396742aaa1d1e8f37b7e452e.jpg"},{"name":"Kaboom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3362750/b130d51f98d070edc21c764c2ade9da085cc55f5.jpg"}],"total":104},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3362750?t=1771247186","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3362750?t=1771247186","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/c1ac84a2ddf0282982dba7d3a75e1a24bdea6d2e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771247186","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/c1ac84a2ddf0282982dba7d3a75e1a24bdea6d2e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771247186","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>About the Developer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hi! I'm YYZ, a solo developer and creator of Stormbridge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I drew inspiration from my life experiences to make my games, and Stormbridge was born from when I went through a stormy period of my life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I care deeply about everything I make, and I am grateful to have help from such an amazing community &amp; talented artists, whose names you'll find in the credits. Everything in my games is made by real people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy Stormbridge, feel free to check out my other games! Thank you for playing and for your support\u00a0\u2764\ufe0f</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/3e08423ab6dd5bac2e25d5179e7e4d93.avif?t=1771247186\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras_big/3e08423ab6dd5bac2e25d5179e7e4d93.avif?t=1771247186 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources as you build, survive, and stay ahead of the relentless storm on your tail. Unlock new epic buildings, build shields to protect your structures, or place turrets and go on the offensive. Brave blizzards and fiery tornadoes - and discover ways to neutralize them before they tear your bridge apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you build the longest bridge and stay ahead of the danger?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/8d3c0b01d73e03f2f8392ef59a84e4e2.poster.avif?t=1771247186\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/8d3c0b01d73e03f2f8392ef59a84e4e2.webm?t=1771247186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/8d3c0b01d73e03f2f8392ef59a84e4e2.mp4?t=1771247186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/ff2d5f36c42dc63c737de8fee4da4551.avif?t=1771247186\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras_big/ff2d5f36c42dc63c737de8fee4da4551.avif?t=1771247186 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settlers are the lifeblood of your bridge settlement. They staff buildings, keep production running, and make sure your resource chains don\u2019t fall apart. Keep them fed, warm, happy, and healthy as the storm closes in, and plan housing and essentials so your community can grow instead of panic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your settlement expands, assign specialized roles like farmers, scientists, and engineers to boost key buildings and unlock stronger systems. The right people in the right jobs can mean the difference between a smooth run and a collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This bridge isn\u2019t just a crossing - it\u2019s a moving, living community you\u2019re trying to keep alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/dc327498db97502171ddc8f87d1379d7.poster.avif?t=1771247186\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/dc327498db97502171ddc8f87d1379d7.webm?t=1771247186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/dc327498db97502171ddc8f87d1379d7.mp4?t=1771247186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/86a685f31110f13141074bdc83c01db2.avif?t=1771247186\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras_big/86a685f31110f13141074bdc83c01db2.avif?t=1771247186 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Losing and restarting is part of the experience! Every run teaches you something new. Permanent upgrades carry over between attempts, making you stronger and helping you push farther each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit adorable companions along the way - whether it\u2019s five unicorns or a whole zoo of critters (dogs, penguins, frogs, chickens, even an armadillo). Each pet grants a unique buff that can shape your strategy. As you progress, you\u2019ll also unlock traits that offer meaningful bonuses, like extra starting resources or faster production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/78e229bb2852839ff32b0bc4ffebe629.poster.avif?t=1771247186\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/78e229bb2852839ff32b0bc4ffebe629.webm?t=1771247186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/78e229bb2852839ff32b0bc4ffebe629.mp4?t=1771247186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/1c3fe284576bb79aa9ed38193ae4afb0.avif?t=1771247186\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras_big/1c3fe284576bb79aa9ed38193ae4afb0.avif?t=1771247186 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across distinct biomes as you piece together clues about the storm\u2019s origins. Each region brings new mechanics, new tools, and new threats - and forces you to adapt your strategy to survive:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tundra:</strong> Find ways to withstand freezing temperatures, manage heat, and keep your settlers from shutting down in the cold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sky:</strong> Launch helicopter expeditions to reach far-off locations, gather valuable resources, and rescue anyone stranded there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Underwater:</strong> Mine scrap and salvage lost tech to manufacture repair bots and keep your bridge running even when the environment turns hostile.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every biome changes how you build, how you plan, and what you\u2019ll need to overcome next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/83b56f521a376b8011405dc69deb8317.poster.avif?t=1771247186\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/83b56f521a376b8011405dc69deb8317.webm?t=1771247186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/83b56f521a376b8011405dc69deb8317.mp4?t=1771247186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/242a0c19d6f6aba61368e6d015c08d38.avif?t=1771247186\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras_big/242a0c19d6f6aba61368e6d015c08d38.avif?t=1771247186 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it\u2019s not all pressure: between runs, you can slow down on your own peaceful island - a cozy, disaster-free space where you use the resources you\u2019ve earned to build your dream home base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock cosmetics too, from glowing hair to fancy accessories, and personalize both your character and your bridge settlement in style.</p><p class=